      "title": "黑夜与白昼·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "34303001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "So busy today，去喝杯coffee放松下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "……Wait，是谁在尾随我？\nShow your face。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "请恕冒昧，阁下可就是伊达氏现任家督……伊达政宗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Correct，有何贵干？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "喂，你是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303006",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "剑刃交错的声音骤然响起——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……好像有什么声音？\n「帕拉斯」，能够定位到声源吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303008",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>距离较远，且存在人类生活噪音干扰，无法定位。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "先分析当前环境情况。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303010",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>检测到现场存在聚氯乙烯与油性漆的残留混合物。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "墙面上还有划痕，曾有手办在这里打斗吗？或许这里就是「恶魔」事件的发生地之一……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我们去别的地方看看有无异常。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303013",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>警告：雷达显示有物体在高速接近，时速为40公里每小时。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "猫？不对，是手办！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……哦呀，看来今晚钓到了一条大鱼呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "晚上好啊，「恶魔」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303017",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>IFF状态更新，目标出现敌对反应。开火限制解除。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34303018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "先瘫痪目标再解释吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "「阿尔贝尔」，把对面撞成流星吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "泉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "等下，刹车！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "好险好险……喂，你不是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550005",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": ">>>IFF状态更新，目标被【希塔】锁定为友方。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我是希塔，前阿尔法军工集团雇员。\n……在那个世界，我们曾经有过非正式的合作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "我当然记得。\n好呀，原来你也作为手办活化了啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我是来调查最近流行的那个都市传说的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "巧了，我也是。\n刚才看到你在案发现场，还以为是犯人回来查看情况了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "等一下，你就是那位在晚上维护正义的「浮游炮小姐」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……我只是做点我该做的事情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哎，管理局的那帮家伙加起来也没你敬业……你上次睡觉是什么时候？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "这不重要。你有关于「恶魔」的线索吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "没有，知道这事还是因为前两天请我送快递的委托者被砍了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "砍了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嗯，手臂的断面很整齐，是被利器切开的。那货完全想不起来怎么回事，还把快递到付的事情忘了个干干净净。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "手办的记忆与涂装密切相关……是因为丢失涂装才失忆了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "应该是这个原因，你在追查这件事？\n那正好，我也加入吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不，我一个人就可以解决。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "这么干脆就拒绝了？看在旧交情的份上都不犹豫一下？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我还有事，先走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "34550022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "喂，急什么。我载你回去？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-789",
